{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Escape in Time? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/d2d653a477fdb5fbb043582c8901c897.poster.avif?t=1737697230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/d2d653a477fdb5fbb043582c8901c897.webm?t=1737697230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/d2d653a477fdb5fbb043582c8901c897.mp4?t=1737697230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another Door is an escape room experience that plunges you into a series of immersive, unsettling environments, each with its own unique story and chilling challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it to the exit either alone or with friends \u2013 the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a trap-filled lair built by a mad scientist, to a haunted doll's room cursed by the spirit of a dead child, and a secret laboratory where hallucinations blur reality, every episode delivers a fresh and thrilling mystery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Than Meets the Eye</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/79f6356201a68ccb82676b797e0e76f2.poster.avif?t=1737697230\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/79f6356201a68ccb82676b797e0e76f2.webm?t=1737697230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/79f6356201a68ccb82676b797e0e76f2.mp4?t=1737697230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another Door offers five distinct episodes, each with a new theme, story, and puzzle mechanics. Players can select episodes as if choosing books from a library, ensuring that no two adventures feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate Test</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/573822a9ebfdfeecb594b825b049f319.poster.avif?t=1737697230\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/573822a9ebfdfeecb594b825b049f319.webm?t=1737697230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/extras/573822a9ebfdfeecb594b825b049f319.mp4?t=1737697230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether facing the unknown alone or with friends, Another Door delivers an unforgettable VR adventure filled with suspense, teamwork, and intricate puzzles that will push your mind to its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Find hidden collectibles scattered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Experience five unique themes with their own puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Escape before it\u2019s too late</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Immersive audio design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Online co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216330?t=1737697230","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737697230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216330/e597a2e41dabcc070a3f28652d25cf20e02d00b2/capsule_231x8